title: The Strike Wave
subtitle: Wages are worth nothing by the time they are paid. Workers walk out.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: rf_mass
view-if: rf_strike_timer <= 0 and party_banned = 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rf_strike_timer = 2

= The Strike Wave

Wildcat strikes break out over wages that lose their value between payday and the shop. The party can support them, or try to turn them into something larger.

- @support
- @politicise
- @general

@support
title: Support the strikers with money and speakers.
subtitle: Brings in members. Pleases the <span class="f-center">Middle Group</span>. Costs 1 fund.
choose-if: funds >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The strike fund is empty.
on-arrival: {!
window.RF.lean(Q, {center: 2});
Q.funds -= 1;
Q.members += 8;
Q.union_influence += 3;
Q.rev_situation += 2;
!}

Communist collections keep the strikers fed for another week. The strikers remember who helped.

@politicise
title: Raise political demands: a workers' government.
subtitle: Pleases the <span class="f-right">Right</span>.
on-arrival: {!
window.RF.lean(Q, {right: 3});
Q.rev_situation += 5;
Q.spd_relation -= 2;
!}

The strike meetings adopt resolutions for a workers' government. Some <span class="p-spd">SPD</span> workers vote for them.

@general
title: Call for a general strike now.
subtitle: Pleases the <span class="f-left">Left</span> and <span class="f-ultra">Ultra-Left</span>. Angers the <span class="f-right">Right</span>. Draws the police.
choose-if: rev_situation >= 60
unavailable-subtitle: The mood is not yet there (revolutionary situation 60 or more).
on-arrival: {!
window.RF.lean(Q, {left: 4, ultra: 3, right: -4});
Q.rev_situation += 8;
Q.readiness += 2;
Q.repression += 8;
Q.spd_relation -= 6;
!}

The call goes out. In some cities the factories empty; in others the unions keep their members at work. The police are ready.
